   "text": "The mightiest of all the beasts that make up the Ashenvale Hunt, Sharptalon is let to wander freely by the self-proclaimed guardians of this land, the night elves.  Sharptalon patrols for prey to the south of here, taking delight in rending the unsuspecting and unaware traveler limb from limb.\n\nTo bring down such a beast would be the mightiest of hauls, $N.  I wish you luck in the hunt for this creature!",
